OL,3,GNEWSA'We are losing customers because
OL,4,Aof nearby landslips'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Worcestershire publican said his
OL,7,Fbusiness is "suffering terribly" due to
OL,8,Fnearby landslips and is calling for
OL,9,Fcouncil compensation.
OL,11,FGiles Goodhew, from The Wellington Inn
OL,12,Fin Malvern, said he feared for the
OL,13,Fpub's future due to the landslide along
OL,14,Fthe A449 at British Camp.
OL,16,F"It's impacted us in a major way," he
OL,17,Fsaid, "the road closure seems to be
OL,18,Fdragging on and on".
